    <!-- HELP.md (Fase 14): the second file behind the Settings tab bar. Prose,
         so FULLY localized, headings included. One item per rendered line: the
         document is markdown SOURCE, and Android collapses a real newline into a
         space. It explains the SHAPE of the app; the words that stand next to a
         number (build, health, coverage, flaky, regression) are glossed in the
